boot-properties.tsv is derived from the configuration metadata of Spring Boot
3.5.16 (META-INF/spring-configuration-metadata.json and
additional-spring-configuration-metadata.json of the artifacts
org.springframework.boot:spring-boot, spring-boot-autoconfigure and
spring-boot-actuator-autoconfigure): property names, types, defaults,
deprecations, value hints and the first sentence of each description.
It also contains the configuration metadata of the Spring Cloud 2025.0.3
release train (org.springframework.cloud: spring-cloud-commons, -context,
-loadbalancer, -config-client, -config-server, -netflix-eureka-client/-server,
-gateway-server, -openfeign-core, -stream and binders, -circuitbreaker-*,
-bus, -consul-*, -zookeeper-*, -kubernetes-*, -vault-config, -contract-*,
-task-core, -function-*), also Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) the Spring
Cloud authors, VMware, Inc. and contributors.
Regenerate it with scripts/gen-metadata.py.

